TEXT 80 120 Left 2 EXPERIMENT - 10  HARTLEY OSCILLATOR USING LTSPICE
TEXT 80 145 Left 2 LTspice companion simulation for the PCB-oriented Experiment 10
TEXT 80 610 Left 2 Manual values: VCC=10V, BF195, R1=47k, R2=10k, RC=1.8k, RE=560, Cc=1u, Ce=1u.
TEXT 80 635 Left 2 Manual does not specify L1/L2/C values; this simulation uses L1=L2=47uH and C=1nF as a marked design assumption.
TEXT 80 660 Left 2 Expected result: sinusoidal oscillation near the calculated ideal frequency f = 1/(2*pi*sqrt((L1+L2)C)).
